; Live-circuit indicator. Unshaded for the same reason as every other glow in
; the game — an emissive/unshaded surface reads at full brightness regardless
; of the room's own lighting, which is exactly what makes a fixture findable
; in an UNMEDICATED fog. AMBER, completing the accent split: dispenser amber-
; warm, keypad cyan, breaker a hotter orange-amber that reads as a mains
; indicator rather than a display.
;
; NOTE it is NOT light-gated. The breaker stays findable after you have thrown
; it, which is what makes the switch a genuine two-way toggle in practice
; rather than only on paper (room16's soft-lock fix depends on being able to
; walk back and turn the lights on again).

[resource]
shading_mode = 0
albedo_color = Color(1.0, 0.58, 0.22, 1)
roughness = 0.9
emission_enabled = true
emission = Color(1.0, 0.51, 0.16, 1)
emission_energy_multiplier = 2.0
